परि-√ शिष् P. -शिनष्टि (Pot. -शिंष्युः), to leave over, leave as a remainder, Br.;
 Ā. (pf. -शिशिषे, ˚षिरे; fut. -शेक्ष्यते) and Pass. -शिष्यते (p. -शिष्यमाण),
to be left as a remainder, 10 remain behind, AV. &c. &c.:
Caus. -शेषयति, to leave over, suffer to remain, spare, Ragh.; Rājat.; Pur.;
to quit or leave, Bhaṭṭ.;
to supply, L.

परि-√ शुच् P. Ā. -शोचति, ˚ते, to mourn, wail, lament (trans. and intrans.), MBh. :
Caus. -शोचयति (ind.p. -शोच्य), to pain, torment, MBh. (B.) vi, 1902;
to lament, bewail, MBh. vii, 10.

परि-√ शुध् P. Ā. -शुध्यति, ˚ते, to be washed off, become clean or purified, Subh.;
 (Ā.) to purify or justify one's self, prove one's innocence, Rājat. :
Caus. -शोधयति, to clear, clean, R.;
to clear off, restore, Yājñ. ii, 146;
to try, examine, Kathās.;
to solve, explain, clear up, Gīt.

परि-√ सृ P. -सरति (pf. -ससार, -सस्रुः; ind.p. -सृत्य),
to flow or go round, circumambulate (acc.), RV. &c. &c.;
to flow or walk about or to and fro, MBh.; BhP.

परि-√ स्रु P. -स्रवति, to flow round or off, stream, trickle, RV. &c. &c.;
 (with acc.) cause to flow, RV.; Hariv.;
to swim or float about, Sāy.;
to glide or pass away (as life), Bhartṛ.

परि-षञ्ज् (√ सञ्ज्) P. -षजति, Pāṇ. viii, 3, 63, Sch.;
 Ā. -सज्जते, to have one's mind fixed on, be attached or devoted to, MBh. :
Desid. -षिषङ्क्षति, Pāṇ. viii, 3, 64, Sch.

परि-षद् (√ सद्) P. -षदति, RV.;
 -षीदति, AV.; MBh. (C. also -सीदति);
to sit round, besiege, beset, RV.; AV.; Kauś.;
to suffer damage, be impaired, MBh.

परि-ष्ठा (√ स्था) P. Ā. -तिष्ठति, ˚ते (pf. -तष्ठौ; fut. -ष्ठास्यति, Pāṇ. viii, 3, 64., Sch.; 3. pl. pf. -तस्थुः, RV.; Pañc.; aor. -ष्ठात्, -ष्ठुः, RV.; -ष्ठाः, Padap.; -स्थाः, AV.),
to stand round, be in a person's way, obstruct, hinder, RV. &c. &c.;
to crowd from all sides, Pañc.;
 (Ā.) to remain, survive, MBh. :
Caus. -स्थापयति (ind.p. -स्थाप्य), to beset, surround, AV.;
to place near, cause to stay close by, Kathās.

परि-ष्यन्द॑ or परि-स्यन्द, m. (√ स्यन्द्; cf. Pāṇ. viii, 3, 72) a river, stream (fig. of words), Bhartṛ.;
 moisture, L.;
 (with ष्) a sandbank, island, ŚBr.; KātyŚr.;
 keeping or entertaining (a sacred fire), MBh. (v.l. -स्पन्द);
 decoration of the hair, L. (v.l. -स्पन्द).

परि-ष्यन्द॑ or परि-स्यन्द, m. (√ स्यन्द्; cf. Pāṇ. viii, 3, 72) a river, stream (fig. of words), Bhartṛ.;
 moisture, L.;
 (with ष्) a sandbank, island, ŚBr.; KātyŚr.;
 keeping or entertaining (a sacred fire), MBh. (v.l. -स्पन्द);
 decoration of the hair, L. (v.l. -स्पन्द).

1. परि-सं-√ ख्या P. -ख्याति (inf. ख्यातुम्), to count, enumerate, ŚāṅkhŚr.; Mn.; MBh.;
to limit to a certain number, KātyŚr., Sch.;
to reckon up, calculate, add together, MBh.; R.; Suśr.;
to make good, restore, Car.; Jaim., Sch.

परि-सम्-√ आप् Pass. -आप्यते, to be fully completed, arrive at completion, BhP.;
to be contained in (loc.), Bhag.;
to relate or belong to (loc. or प्रति), Pat.

परि-√ साध् Caus. -साधयति, to overpower, subject, Hariv.; Kām.;
to settle, arrange, Mn. viii, 187 ;
to prepare (food), Pañcar.

परि-√ सृप् P. Ā. -सर्पति, ˚ते (ind.p. -स॑र्पम्), to move round about or to and fro, hover, RV.; ŚBr.; MBh. &c.;
to creep or crawl upon, Gobh. (see ˚सृप्त);
to be near, approach, go to (acc.), MBh. :
Caus. See ˚सर्पित.

परि-√ स्तृ P. Ā. -स्तृणोति, ˚णुते, or -स्तृणाति, ˚णीते (perf. 3. pl. -तस्तरुः, Bhaṭṭ., -तस्तरिरे, Śiś.; ind.p. -स्तीर्य, GṛS.; Ved. inf. प॑रिस्तरीतवै॑, MaitrS. [cf. Pāṇ. vi, 2, 51, Sch.]),
to strew or lay round, enclose (as fire with grass), AV.; ŚBr. &c.;
to envelop, cover (lit. and fig.), Kir.; Śiś.;
to spread, extend, GṛS.; R. &c.

परि-√ स्फुर् P. -स्फुरति, to throb, quiver, vibrate, Kāv.;
to glitter, gleam, BhP.;
to burst forth, appear, Kull.

परीष् (परि- √ 3. इष्) P. पर्य्-एषति (aor. पर्य्-ऐषिषत्), to seek or search about for, ChUp.; MBh.;
 (Ā.), SaddhP. :
Caus. पर्य्-एषयति id., SaddhP.
